WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.322 --> 01:47.960
=Episode 21=

01:51.147 --> 01:52.106
What are you buying?

01:52.347 --> 01:54.227
Comrade, I'm not here to shop.

01:54.427 --> 01:55.266
I'm here for my wife.

01:55.507 --> 01:56.627
This is the cooperative.

01:56.906 --> 01:57.947
Your wife isn't here.

01:58.140 --> 01:59.693
If you're not shopping, please leave.

02:00.106 --> 02:01.507
Fine. Then I'll buy.

02:04.106 --> 02:05.867
Ms. Chen, 1500 g of fruit candy.

02:06.666 --> 02:08.866
Zhang, cut me
the best fabric you've got.

02:08.866 --> 02:10.747
Ding, 1000 g of rice.

02:10.747 --> 02:11.947
Fei Ting, what are you doing?

02:12.204 --> 02:13.700
Why are you spending
all your money?

02:13.706 --> 02:14.666
None of your business.

02:14.907 --> 02:16.067
You're not my wife.

02:16.907 --> 02:17.507
Thank you.

02:17.666 --> 02:18.666
I'll take a kettle, too.

02:19.227 --> 02:20.826
And some meat as well.

02:20.826 --> 02:21.426
Excuse me.

02:21.426 --> 02:22.467
The meat looks good.

02:22.467 --> 02:23.347
Indeed.

02:23.426 --> 02:24.187
Very fresh.

02:24.586 --> 02:25.347
Wu.

02:25.347 --> 02:26.227
250 g pork.

02:26.227 --> 02:26.747
Give it here.

02:27.866 --> 02:28.706
What are you doing?

02:29.507 --> 02:30.106
Come outside.

02:31.270 --> 02:33.382
(Supply and Marketing Cooperative)
What's the matter, Comrade?

02:33.507 --> 02:34.146
I'm here to shop.

02:34.146 --> 02:35.146
Why are you dragging me?

02:35.826 --> 02:38.507
I haven't even
finished buying my stuff!

02:38.507 --> 02:38.907
Fei Ting!

02:40.546 --> 02:41.986
Don't try to play games with me.

02:43.546 --> 02:45.426
You want me to go home with you? Fine.

02:45.820 --> 02:47.915
Go get your job back
at the Publicity Division.

02:50.227 --> 02:50.586
Lin Mei.

02:52.307 --> 02:53.747
Do you actually want a life with me,

02:54.404 --> 02:56.340
or with a clerk
from the Publicity Division?

02:56.666 --> 02:57.666
What's the difference?

02:58.307 --> 02:59.747
Aren't you a clerk there?

02:59.947 --> 03:01.747
No. I'm not.

03:02.507 --> 03:04.347
Even if I sit there every day,

03:04.507 --> 03:06.546
I've never truly been one of them.

03:07.467 --> 03:10.106
A real Publicity Division clerk
should love writing,

03:10.307 --> 03:11.347
love reading,

03:11.706 --> 03:13.826
carry a pen at all times,

03:13.947 --> 03:15.266
and maybe even wear glasses.

03:15.706 --> 03:16.627
But is that me?

03:17.627 --> 03:18.266
That's not me.

03:20.146 --> 03:21.787
And being covered in kitchen smoke

03:22.307 --> 03:23.507
and selling sweet potatoes?

03:23.507 --> 03:24.227
Is that you?

03:24.307 --> 03:24.747
Exactly.

03:25.507 --> 03:26.307
Smelling of smoke,

03:26.307 --> 03:28.067
warm and passionate,
steady and reliable.

03:28.627 --> 03:29.546
That's who I am.

03:30.507 --> 03:32.027
Lin Mei, take you for example.

03:32.507 --> 03:33.986
I love that sharp,

03:33.986 --> 03:35.106
straight-talking fire in you.

03:36.027 --> 03:37.706
But I've never expected

03:37.706 --> 03:39.146
you to be like Ni,

03:39.146 --> 03:41.426
writing brilliant essays, right?

03:43.467 --> 03:44.960
Don't make it sound like

03:44.960 --> 03:46.960
I'm asking the world of you.

03:47.947 --> 03:50.706
I'm not forcing you to write anything.

03:51.507 --> 03:53.666
But you should
at least have a decent job.

03:53.666 --> 03:55.546
A decent job is one I actually like.

03:57.146 --> 03:58.027
Look at Fang Muyang.

03:58.307 --> 03:59.507
He's a returning educated youth

03:59.507 --> 04:00.666
and a hero who saved lives.

04:01.004 --> 04:02.940
But he never wrecked
the Educated Youth Office

04:02.947 --> 04:04.146
just to land a "good" job.

04:04.826 --> 04:06.347
Isn't he doing fine now?

04:08.907 --> 04:09.507
I'll be fine

04:10.386 --> 04:11.627
even without

04:12.027 --> 04:13.347
the Publicity Division job.

04:15.604 --> 04:16.820
How exactly do you do that?

04:17.307 --> 04:18.867
By catering banquet meals for people.

04:19.226 --> 04:20.499
With just three bookings a month,

04:20.500 --> 04:22.170
I'll make as much as I do
at the factory.

04:22.226 --> 04:23.947
If people like the food,

04:24.146 --> 04:26.466
I might even get into
a state-owned restaurant.

04:27.786 --> 04:29.107
A state-owned restaurant?

04:29.293 --> 04:31.471
You can't even get
into a work-unit canteen.

04:34.706 --> 04:35.507
Lin Mei,

04:37.706 --> 04:39.706
can you accept the real Fei Ting?

04:42.747 --> 04:44.107
What choice do I have if I can't?

04:45.706 --> 04:46.547
Divorce you?

04:48.947 --> 04:51.026
I'm managing the money
and the ration coupons.

04:51.466 --> 04:52.586
If you need money, ask me.

04:53.627 --> 04:54.067
Yes!

04:57.947 --> 04:58.906
Starting next month,

04:59.466 --> 05:00.547
you bring in thirty yuan.

05:00.893 --> 05:02.100
If you don't make enough,

05:02.266 --> 05:02.947
I'll...

05:09.146 --> 05:10.266
I'm heading to work.

05:15.507 --> 05:16.266
Come home tonight.

05:17.260 --> 05:18.626
I'll cook something delicious.

05:32.987 --> 05:34.197
Wash your feet.

05:42.146 --> 05:43.947
I'll check if the fuse blew.

05:44.906 --> 05:45.987
Be careful.

06:20.427 --> 06:22.427
Who left this metal basin here?

06:22.427 --> 06:23.627
What happened?

06:23.947 --> 06:24.627
Fang Muyang!

06:24.627 --> 06:25.107
Fei Ni!

06:25.107 --> 06:26.987
- What's wrong?
- Quick! He's bleeding!

06:27.627 --> 06:28.346
What happened?

06:28.466 --> 06:29.097
Look at this!

06:29.097 --> 06:29.706
What happened?

06:29.706 --> 06:31.706
I tripped and hit my head on it.

06:32.906 --> 06:33.706
Let me see.

06:33.706 --> 06:34.627
Look!

06:34.747 --> 06:35.906
Quick, go to the hospital.

06:35.906 --> 06:37.386
No, I'll just put some iodine on it.

06:37.386 --> 06:39.507
Just go! Your head
was already injured before.

06:39.507 --> 06:40.427
Go on!

06:40.427 --> 06:41.107
Thanks, Chief Wang.

06:41.107 --> 06:41.947
Go on. It's fine.

06:42.947 --> 06:44.466
How could you be so clumsy?

06:45.427 --> 06:46.547
Let's go.

06:49.146 --> 06:50.146
Slow down.

06:54.235 --> 06:57.947
(Jiangcheng Worker-Peasant Hospital)

06:58.507 --> 06:59.826
The wound isn't too deep.

06:59.987 --> 07:01.427
He's had a tetanus shot.

07:01.826 --> 07:03.947
But since he had a prior head injury,

07:03.947 --> 07:05.090
there could be complications.

07:05.107 --> 07:07.107
We recommend 24 hours of observation.

07:07.786 --> 07:08.547
Thank you.

07:08.547 --> 07:09.906
It's nothing. Call if you need me.

07:15.987 --> 07:17.187
I'm sorry.

07:18.107 --> 07:19.226
I scared you, didn't I?

07:20.760 --> 07:22.020
I'll be more careful next time.

07:24.093 --> 07:26.100
I was just worried
you'd hurt your head again,

07:26.382 --> 07:28.220
and I'd have to
nurse you all over again.

07:38.226 --> 07:40.026
Is this the same bed I had last time?

07:40.786 --> 07:41.586
Why?

07:42.427 --> 07:43.786
Feeling sentimental?

07:46.586 --> 07:48.586
You must've been
so annoyed with me back then.

07:50.426 --> 07:51.900
I just lay there, unconscious.

07:53.386 --> 07:54.627
Then, I woke up with amnesia.

07:56.226 --> 07:57.947
Fate really is strange.

07:58.547 --> 07:59.667
We're back here again,

08:00.826 --> 08:02.386
but now you're my spouse.

08:09.386 --> 08:10.346
You talk too much.

08:11.493 --> 08:12.780
Doesn't that hurt your head?

08:16.747 --> 08:18.307
Can you trim my nails for me again?

08:24.427 --> 08:25.427
Fang Muyang,

08:25.427 --> 08:26.786
didn't you learn how?

08:27.586 --> 08:28.386
I forgot.

08:29.427 --> 08:30.987
I've been biting them lately.

08:32.986 --> 08:34.706
You just want me to do it, don't you?

08:57.787 --> 08:58.907
Chief Wang,

08:58.907 --> 09:00.907
Ms. Xu takes our factory's evaluation

09:00.907 --> 09:02.586
for Advanced Production Unit seriously.

09:02.787 --> 09:04.267
The Publicity Division must make sure

09:04.267 --> 09:06.986
the spirit is conveyed
accurately to every worker.

09:07.027 --> 09:09.106
I know. It must be urgent,

09:09.187 --> 09:10.826
or you wouldn't have come in the dark.

09:11.826 --> 09:12.787
The power's back.

09:12.787 --> 09:13.387
Feng Lin,

09:13.387 --> 09:14.427
come in for some water.

09:14.427 --> 09:15.027
No, it's fine.

09:15.027 --> 09:16.427
I need to stop by Chief Cao's place.

09:16.907 --> 09:17.907
The very first unit.

09:17.907 --> 09:19.027
I know.

09:21.226 --> 09:21.947
I'll get going.

09:22.147 --> 09:22.746
Chief Wang.

09:57.747 --> 09:59.906
(This should've been my home.)

10:22.847 --> 10:27.147
(Pride and Prejudice)

10:39.506 --> 10:40.466
Nurse Zhou.

10:40.466 --> 10:40.787
Yes?

10:40.787 --> 10:41.547
When he wakes up,

10:41.547 --> 10:43.586
tell him I went home
to grab a few things.

10:43.706 --> 10:44.866
Sure. Don't worry.

10:44.866 --> 10:45.307
Thank you.

10:45.307 --> 10:45.746
It's fine.

11:18.746 --> 11:19.787
You're back.

11:24.760 --> 11:26.426
(Pride and Prejudice)
Fei Ni.

11:26.626 --> 11:28.427
You've got some nerve.

11:39.147 --> 11:40.986
Fang!

11:40.986 --> 11:41.547
Chief Wang?

11:41.626 --> 11:42.900
Fei Ni was reading banned books.

11:43.187 --> 11:45.387
Feng Lin and factory security
took her away.

11:52.226 --> 11:53.506
Whose books are these?

11:54.826 --> 11:55.346
Mine.

11:55.346 --> 11:56.547
Where did you get them?

11:59.626 --> 12:00.147
I found them.

12:00.147 --> 12:00.947
Found them?

12:01.427 --> 12:02.307
Where?

12:02.346 --> 12:03.226
When?

12:03.226 --> 12:04.387
Can you prove it?

12:05.787 --> 12:07.626
Fei Ni! Fei Ni!

12:08.346 --> 12:09.866
Fei Ni! Fei Ni!

12:10.271 --> 12:12.260
(Strive, Be Diligent and Thrifty)
Fei Ni! Fei Ni!

12:12.706 --> 12:13.586
Feng Lin!

12:13.746 --> 12:14.506
Get out!

12:14.737 --> 12:15.260
Feng Lin!

12:15.267 --> 12:16.547
Playing the hero, huh?

12:16.787 --> 12:17.586
Come and face me!

12:17.586 --> 12:18.680
More like a moth to a flame.

12:18.693 --> 12:19.460
Come out!

12:19.466 --> 12:19.947
Feng Lin!

12:19.947 --> 12:21.346
Stop. Sit down.

12:21.346 --> 12:22.147
Feng Lin!

12:27.027 --> 12:28.466
Feng Lin,

12:28.466 --> 12:29.506
the books are mine.

12:30.506 --> 12:31.387
Arrest me instead.

12:31.387 --> 12:32.667
They're not Fang Muyang's books.

12:32.907 --> 12:33.947
They're all mine.

12:36.626 --> 12:37.466
Let Fei Ni go.

12:38.427 --> 12:39.547
The books aren't hers.

12:39.667 --> 12:40.746
He had no idea.

12:40.746 --> 12:42.267
I read them behind his back.

12:43.866 --> 12:45.427
How could I let her know about this?

12:45.866 --> 12:46.787
If she did,

12:46.787 --> 12:47.787
she'd report me herself

12:48.093 --> 12:49.180
for the greater good.

12:49.187 --> 12:50.667
The handwritten copies are mine too.

12:50.667 --> 12:52.067
I didn't do the handwriting.

12:52.187 --> 12:53.427
I had someone copy them for me!

12:53.866 --> 12:55.226
Illegally possessing banned books?

12:55.466 --> 12:57.147
Circulating handwritten copies.

12:57.466 --> 12:58.626
The evidence is conclusive.

13:14.267 --> 13:15.067
Fei Ni!

13:16.746 --> 13:18.907
Fei Ni! Fei Ni!

13:21.427 --> 13:22.147
Fang Muyang?

13:22.147 --> 13:25.226
Fei Ni! Fei Ni! Fei Ni!

13:26.307 --> 13:27.147
Fang Muyang...

13:31.346 --> 13:32.187
Fang Muyang!

13:32.466 --> 13:33.466
I'm right here.

13:33.667 --> 13:34.626
I'm here, Fei Ni.

13:36.147 --> 13:37.866
Fang Muyang, listen to me.

13:37.866 --> 13:39.187
Feng Lin is coming after me.

13:39.187 --> 13:40.360
It has nothing to do with you.

13:40.466 --> 13:41.667
Don't admit anything.

13:42.382 --> 13:44.340
My family's been workers
for three generations.

13:44.586 --> 13:46.187
At worst, they'll fire me.

13:46.187 --> 13:47.027
But they could

13:47.027 --> 13:48.667
actually arrest you.

13:50.427 --> 13:51.826
I already signed the confession.

13:51.826 --> 13:52.947
Did you hear me?

13:58.547 --> 13:59.667
I signed it, too.

14:05.466 --> 14:07.626
I wanted to play the hero

14:09.937 --> 14:11.140
and take all the blame myself.

14:15.586 --> 14:16.667
Looks like I can't.

14:26.147 --> 14:26.947
Fei Ni,

14:29.346 --> 14:31.226
whatever we're about to face,

14:34.547 --> 14:35.667
I'm right here with you.

14:53.427 --> 14:54.387
Ms. Xu,

14:54.866 --> 14:56.667
a bad element like Fei Ni

14:56.667 --> 14:57.866
must be dealt with severely.

14:59.387 --> 15:00.187
I suggest

15:00.547 --> 15:02.547
we hold a factory-wide assembly

15:02.667 --> 15:03.506
to criticize her,

15:03.506 --> 15:04.267
then expel her.

15:05.147 --> 15:06.346
We should even invite comrades

15:06.346 --> 15:07.387
from Jiangcheng Daily.

15:07.466 --> 15:10.267
We must make an example of her.

15:10.267 --> 15:11.267
Show zero tolerance!

15:14.497 --> 15:15.667
(Pride and Prejudice)

15:15.667 --> 15:16.667
Feng.

15:17.706 --> 15:18.147
Yes?

15:18.427 --> 15:19.667
Do you know

15:20.187 --> 15:21.307
what our factory's

15:22.267 --> 15:24.307
main priority is right now?

15:25.427 --> 15:26.466
Boost production.

15:26.746 --> 15:27.746
Promote work.

15:28.106 --> 15:29.947
Build socialism better and faster.

15:30.787 --> 15:31.866
Be specific.

15:33.106 --> 15:34.586
The task I assigned you yesterday.

15:36.226 --> 15:36.667
Oh,

15:37.746 --> 15:39.746
the evaluation for
Advanced Production Unit.

15:39.746 --> 15:40.466
Exactly.

15:41.067 --> 15:42.586
At such a critical moment,

15:43.506 --> 15:45.466
if a "bad element"

15:45.466 --> 15:46.859
came from our factory

15:46.860 --> 15:48.871
after years of hiding
and avoiding detection,

15:49.466 --> 15:50.307
tell me,

15:51.187 --> 15:53.106
where does that leave

15:53.506 --> 15:54.746
our claim to excellence?

15:55.746 --> 15:57.506
Catching one bad element,

15:57.947 --> 16:00.346
or securing
the Advanced Production title?

16:00.466 --> 16:01.826
Which matters

16:02.027 --> 16:03.466
at the moment?

16:04.547 --> 16:05.746
Of course, it's...

16:08.947 --> 16:11.106
The Advanced Production title.

16:12.226 --> 16:13.626
At least you understand that.

16:17.746 --> 16:18.947
Ms. Xu,

16:20.226 --> 16:22.147
are we just letting Fei Ni off the hook?

16:22.427 --> 16:23.947
Of course not.

16:25.586 --> 16:26.626
But don't go around

16:26.626 --> 16:28.547
slapping bad labels on comrades.

16:29.106 --> 16:30.226
I heard you even

16:30.586 --> 16:31.746
mobilized the Security Section

16:31.866 --> 16:33.346
and locked them in a room.

16:33.667 --> 16:35.267
Is the Security Section yours

16:35.267 --> 16:36.746
to command at will?

16:37.226 --> 16:38.466
Was that room

16:38.466 --> 16:40.307
yours to use as you please?

16:40.746 --> 16:41.866
I'm sorry, Ms. Xu.

16:43.307 --> 16:44.547
I acted in haste.

16:45.267 --> 16:47.307
I won't discipline you this time.

16:48.427 --> 16:49.866
But this matter

16:50.226 --> 16:51.947
goes no further.

16:55.722 --> 16:56.672
(Confession Letter)

16:56.740 --> 16:57.782
(Fang Muyang)
Ms. Xu...

16:58.307 --> 16:59.706
What about the two of them?

16:59.866 --> 17:00.506
Do we...

17:01.907 --> 17:03.106
Keep them locked up for a bit.

17:03.506 --> 17:05.306
Maybe they'll stop causing me trouble.

17:17.867 --> 17:18.667
Mujing!

17:21.466 --> 17:22.466
What are you doing here?

17:24.026 --> 17:24.947
What did you buy?

17:26.466 --> 17:28.546
Want to come visit
a relative with me again?

17:29.867 --> 17:31.587
You really love visiting relatives.

17:31.867 --> 17:33.147
Depends on whose relative.

17:33.867 --> 17:34.459
Come on.

17:34.460 --> 17:36.448
I bought some local delicacies
for your brother.

17:37.347 --> 17:38.786
Let me drop something off first.

17:39.266 --> 17:40.066
Okay.

17:42.226 --> 17:43.867
Has the hospital arranged your dorm yet?

17:44.026 --> 17:44.867
Yes.

17:44.947 --> 17:46.587
I mailed my things over a few days ago.

17:47.347 --> 17:48.746
Want to go take a look?

17:49.827 --> 17:50.706
Not really.

18:04.737 --> 18:06.180
What's going on with their family?

18:14.627 --> 18:15.466
Who are you?

18:15.667 --> 18:17.466
Oh, you're Fang Muyang's sister, right?

18:17.867 --> 18:18.867
What happened to them?

18:18.867 --> 18:20.387
It's seriously bad news.

18:32.667 --> 18:33.667
Don't panic.

18:34.867 --> 18:36.026
This route won't work.

18:36.187 --> 18:37.226
I'll think of another way.

18:39.737 --> 18:41.140
Unless it's absolutely necessary,

18:41.147 --> 18:42.266
don't step in yourself.

18:42.986 --> 18:44.459
I don't want to drag your parents in

18:44.460 --> 18:45.804
because of my family's trouble.

18:47.786 --> 18:49.667
My parents are your parents too.

19:07.427 --> 19:08.147
Ling Yi.

19:09.867 --> 19:10.827
Jing.

19:11.266 --> 19:11.899
Why are you...

19:11.900 --> 19:14.204
Do you know Fang Muyang
and Fei Ni are in trouble?

19:15.667 --> 19:16.306
No.

19:25.272 --> 19:25.972
In the end,

19:25.972 --> 19:27.872
this will land in Xu Hongqi's hands.

19:28.585 --> 19:29.664
We're hoping

19:29.960 --> 19:31.537
you could put in a good word for them.

19:32.085 --> 19:33.805
I'm not sure I can help.

19:33.860 --> 19:36.221
After all, Ye Feng and I
haven't been married long.

19:36.466 --> 19:37.746
I believe with your ability,

19:37.746 --> 19:38.667
if you're willing,

19:39.026 --> 19:40.427
you can persuade Xu Hongqi.

19:44.947 --> 19:46.147
Will you help him?

19:53.226 --> 19:54.427
Comrade Ling Yi,

19:54.427 --> 19:55.947
if it puts you in a difficult position,

19:56.147 --> 19:58.226
could you at least take us to your home

19:58.226 --> 19:59.427
to see Ms. Xu?

20:06.387 --> 20:06.947
All right.

20:13.187 --> 20:14.347
Comrade Qu Hua,

20:14.867 --> 20:17.147
you come from a military family.

20:17.546 --> 20:18.706
You should understand

20:19.546 --> 20:20.546
the magnitude

20:21.147 --> 20:22.466
of their situation.

20:24.587 --> 20:25.347
I know.

20:25.907 --> 20:27.266
That's why I came to ask

20:27.627 --> 20:28.947
if there's any room to maneuver.

20:36.387 --> 20:37.306
The books are mine.

20:44.107 --> 20:44.867
Ours.

20:46.466 --> 20:47.627
My spouse and I

20:47.627 --> 20:48.466
put those things

20:48.466 --> 20:50.786
in Fang Muyang and Fei Ni's home.

20:50.947 --> 20:52.506
They had no idea

20:52.506 --> 20:53.627
what was inside.

20:54.347 --> 20:55.986
So if anyone's to be held responsible,

20:56.910 --> 20:58.347
it should be us.

21:05.135 --> 21:06.585
(Beijing Souvenir)

21:20.447 --> 21:21.727
What's wrong?

21:24.986 --> 21:26.627
You're not going to help Fei Ni?

21:27.066 --> 21:28.226
Ling Yi,

21:28.226 --> 21:28.867
I swear,

21:28.867 --> 21:30.627
I have no feelings left for Fei Ni.

21:30.627 --> 21:31.867
I believe you.

21:33.667 --> 21:35.187
I just think

21:35.786 --> 21:37.147
they were wrong,

21:37.427 --> 21:38.867
but it's not this serious.

21:40.786 --> 21:42.147
Could you

21:42.147 --> 21:43.786
speak to Mom for them?

21:45.867 --> 21:46.667
All right.

21:47.546 --> 21:49.627
I actually wanted to say something,

21:49.867 --> 21:50.786
but I was afraid

21:50.786 --> 21:52.026
you'd think I still had feelings

21:52.026 --> 21:52.827
for her.

21:53.266 --> 21:54.466
Now that you've asked,

21:54.667 --> 21:55.546
leave it to me.

21:58.422 --> 22:00.985
(Beijing Souvenir)

22:01.786 --> 22:03.066
Comrade Qu Hua,

22:03.466 --> 22:04.627
this isn't a claim

22:05.147 --> 22:06.947
to make so lightly.

22:08.867 --> 22:09.427
Yes.

22:10.986 --> 22:13.226
But as their sister and brother-in-law,

22:13.387 --> 22:15.627
we can't let them take the fall for us.

22:19.947 --> 22:21.867
If that's really the case,

22:22.147 --> 22:23.347
then I'll have to

22:23.827 --> 22:26.147
report it truthfully
to Jiangcheng University

22:26.786 --> 22:28.226
and Jiangcheng People's Hospital.

22:35.026 --> 22:35.867
Mom,

22:36.667 --> 22:38.066
is that really necessary?

22:38.466 --> 22:39.947
It's not that big a deal.

22:39.947 --> 22:41.947
Why take it to the college
and the hospital?

22:42.466 --> 22:43.746
This doesn't concern you.

22:44.026 --> 22:45.060
Go back to your room.

22:45.226 --> 22:46.259
How does it not concern me?

22:46.260 --> 22:48.715
I'm an employee of Jiangcheng
No. 1 Textile Factory too.

22:48.730 --> 22:49.867
I have the right to speak up.

22:50.867 --> 22:52.266
And what exactly is your opinion?

22:52.466 --> 22:54.266
Anyone with eyes can see that

22:54.667 --> 22:55.746
this whole thing

22:55.746 --> 22:57.627
was Feng Lin's attempt to sabotage

22:57.627 --> 22:58.546
Fei Ni and Fang Muyang.

22:58.706 --> 23:00.427
It's their personal grudge.

23:00.427 --> 23:02.147
Be careful you're not being used.

23:03.026 --> 23:03.746
Besides,

23:04.266 --> 23:05.187
Feng Lin

23:05.427 --> 23:07.066
mobilized the Security Section

23:07.066 --> 23:09.187
and locked people up
without your approval.

23:09.266 --> 23:10.226
What is that?

23:10.466 --> 23:11.827
She's overstepping her authority.

23:12.947 --> 23:13.867
If you ask me,

23:14.266 --> 23:15.867
it's just a few lousy books.

23:16.147 --> 23:16.867
You could

23:16.867 --> 23:18.619
give them a mild reprimand,

23:18.620 --> 23:19.871
and that'd be the end of it.

23:20.226 --> 23:21.347
We don't actually believe

23:21.347 --> 23:22.706
Fei Ni and Fang Muyang

23:22.706 --> 23:23.947
became "bad elements"

23:23.947 --> 23:25.226
over a few books, do we?

23:25.746 --> 23:27.026
I don't believe it, Mom.

23:32.466 --> 23:33.347
Come to think of it,

23:33.466 --> 23:34.546
many at universities

23:34.546 --> 23:36.066
are reading these books privately.

23:36.266 --> 23:37.226
And the professors

23:37.226 --> 23:38.387
are fairly tolerant.

23:39.466 --> 23:40.387
Ms. Xu,

23:40.582 --> 23:42.580
as a leader of
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory,

23:43.026 --> 23:45.107
you must also feel that
the times are changing.

23:46.466 --> 23:47.986
We should give young people

23:47.986 --> 23:49.947
more opportunities to grow and learn.

24:31.187 --> 24:32.187
Are you all right?

24:35.266 --> 24:36.667
All right, come out.

24:42.648 --> 24:43.937
(Interrogation Room 1)
Comrade.

24:44.867 --> 24:45.827
Where are we going?

24:45.827 --> 24:46.627
Downstairs.

25:06.986 --> 25:07.746
Ms. Xu.

25:18.746 --> 25:19.546
Ms. Xu.

25:21.546 --> 25:22.706
In the spirit of

25:23.026 --> 25:24.226
saving the patients,

25:24.827 --> 25:26.266
and learning from past mistakes,

25:26.760 --> 25:28.560
I've decided
to give you one more chance.

25:29.867 --> 25:31.026
From this point on,

25:31.271 --> 25:33.048
I won't pursue the matter further.

25:33.347 --> 25:36.867
However, given your disregard
for organizational discipline,

25:37.293 --> 25:38.220
it's been decided that

25:38.546 --> 25:40.147
you will be criticized factory-wide,

25:40.667 --> 25:42.827
and the dormitory allocated to you
will be taken back,

25:43.226 --> 25:44.306
pending further observation.

25:54.187 --> 25:56.587
It's fine.
You can stay as long as you want.

25:56.746 --> 25:57.907
The house is big enough.

25:57.907 --> 25:58.627
Exactly.

25:58.627 --> 25:59.786
You, me, Mom,

25:59.786 --> 26:01.627
the three of us can
sleep here. It's fine.

26:01.627 --> 26:02.347
Yeah.

26:02.347 --> 26:03.107
Ting.

26:03.107 --> 26:04.259
Three people is nothing.

26:04.260 --> 26:05.560
In Great Northern Wilderness,

26:05.580 --> 26:06.947
I shared a bed with eighteen people.

26:07.986 --> 26:08.667
Ni,

26:08.667 --> 26:10.266
losing the house is no big deal.

26:10.706 --> 26:12.506
As long as we're together,

26:12.506 --> 26:13.026
it's lively.

26:15.306 --> 26:15.786
Dad,

26:16.427 --> 26:17.266
Fei Ni can stay here.

26:17.867 --> 26:19.226
I won't squeeze in with you.

26:19.582 --> 26:21.493
I'll sleep in
my brother-in-law's living room.

26:21.546 --> 26:22.347
There's more space.

26:22.947 --> 26:24.347
There's room here. It's all set up.

26:24.347 --> 26:25.187
Everything's ready.

26:25.187 --> 26:25.746
Just stay here.

26:25.746 --> 26:26.706
I know there's room.

26:26.848 --> 26:28.537
I just don't want you sleeping poorly.

26:28.947 --> 26:29.546
Fei Ni,

26:30.066 --> 26:30.587
I'll go.

26:30.587 --> 26:31.026
Hey.

26:31.026 --> 26:31.506
Dad,

26:31.947 --> 26:32.466
Mom.

26:32.907 --> 26:33.907
I'll walk him out.

26:43.066 --> 26:43.827
Go back inside.

26:54.315 --> 26:55.871
I want to walk you a bit farther.

27:05.760 --> 27:09.985
♪Summer, by my ears♪

27:10.260 --> 27:13.980
♪The wind sweeps
through the wheat fields♪

27:15.587 --> 27:16.226
Okay.

27:18.066 --> 27:18.986
We're here.

27:19.827 --> 27:20.506
Go home.

27:23.820 --> 27:27.100
♪Smiles in my eyes♪

27:27.580 --> 27:31.540
♪Sweet as if dipped in honey♪

27:36.122 --> 27:40.860
♪Stain the passing years red♪

27:41.235 --> 27:44.697
♪Talk a little, listen a little♪

27:44.860 --> 27:49.100
♪Let time settle♪

27:49.660 --> 27:53.620
♪Feel the warm breeze♪

27:53.620 --> 27:57.860
♪Carry us into tomorrow♪

27:58.460 --> 28:02.540
♪When someday, some promise♪

28:02.540 --> 28:06.340
♪Is treasured deep inside our hearts♪

28:06.340 --> 28:09.972
♪It becomes the most beautiful moment
we pursue together♪

28:10.066 --> 28:12.187
(Even though our marriage
started out fake,)

28:12.306 --> 28:13.147
(still,)

28:13.427 --> 28:14.506
(the days ahead of us)

28:14.506 --> 28:16.466
(are real,
and we'll live them together.)

28:17.107 --> 28:17.867
(Fei Ni,)

28:18.226 --> 28:20.266
(thank you for letting me
be part of your family.)

28:21.266 --> 28:22.107
(Fang Muyang,)

28:22.907 --> 28:24.387
(we finally have a home.)

28:24.867 --> 28:26.546
(I really love this home.)

28:27.347 --> 28:28.907
(I really do.)

28:30.066 --> 28:31.746
(What do you think marriage means?)

28:32.248 --> 28:33.460
(One mind has its limits,)

28:34.387 --> 28:35.466
(two minds see farther.)

28:38.107 --> 28:39.187
(In life,)

28:39.804 --> 28:41.740
(it's not just
distant goals that matter,)

28:43.471 --> 28:45.115
(but the scenery close at heart.)

28:46.786 --> 28:47.947
(My feelings for her)

28:49.266 --> 28:50.667
(were never just dependence,)

28:53.187 --> 28:53.986
(but love.)

28:54.506 --> 28:56.587
(You're not alone anymore.)

28:56.648 --> 28:57.820
(So whatever you're feeling,)

28:57.827 --> 29:00.187
(whether you're happy or upset,)

29:00.187 --> 29:01.706
(you can tell me.)

29:02.746 --> 29:03.986
(A house doesn't matter.)

29:05.147 --> 29:06.187
(Having you is enough.)

29:06.272 --> 29:08.235
♪Feel the warm breeze♪

29:08.335 --> 29:12.500
♪Carry us into tomorrow♪

29:13.180 --> 29:16.860
♪When someday, some promise♪

29:16.860 --> 29:21.100
♪Is treasured deep inside our hearts♪

29:21.100 --> 29:26.380
♪It becomes the most beautiful moment♪

29:26.380 --> 29:30.460
♪We pursue together♪

30:00.546 --> 30:01.546
It's an earthquake!

30:01.546 --> 30:02.466
Fei Ting! Fei Ni!

30:02.466 --> 30:04.266
Get out! Hurry, get out!

30:04.266 --> 30:06.347
Quick, quick! Let's go!

30:06.466 --> 30:09.147
Move, move! Careful!

30:10.107 --> 30:10.907
Go!

30:10.907 --> 30:11.907
Hurry, Dad!

30:12.187 --> 30:13.667
Watch your step!

30:15.466 --> 30:16.746
Help!

30:16.746 --> 30:17.786
Somebody help!

30:17.786 --> 30:18.947
Over here!

30:19.147 --> 30:19.986
Quick!

30:20.827 --> 30:22.066
Get a ladder! Help them down!

30:38.627 --> 30:40.187
Move!

30:40.187 --> 30:40.867
Hurry up!

30:53.986 --> 30:55.226
Is anyone still inside?

30:57.107 --> 30:57.427
Go!

30:57.427 --> 30:58.226
You go first!

31:02.387 --> 31:03.706
Mom!

31:04.187 --> 31:05.506
Mom!

31:10.427 --> 31:15.026
Mom!

31:23.587 --> 31:24.627
Hurry, hurry!

31:24.627 --> 31:26.546
Several women are injured over there!

31:26.746 --> 31:27.746
Let's head that way!

31:27.746 --> 31:28.786
It's safer there!

31:30.466 --> 31:31.387
Has anyone seen Fei Ni?

31:31.387 --> 31:32.347
No.

31:32.867 --> 31:33.786
Has anyone seen Fei Ni?

31:33.786 --> 31:35.506
Let's stay in the courtyard tonight.

31:35.907 --> 31:36.947
Has anyone seen Fei Ni?

31:36.947 --> 31:37.587
Women and children rest first...

31:37.587 --> 31:38.107
Fei Ni!

31:38.147 --> 31:39.107
Has anyone seen Fei Ni?

31:39.506 --> 31:40.506
Fei Ni!

31:40.697 --> 31:41.937
Fei Ni!

31:43.285 --> 31:44.565
Fei Ni!

31:47.885 --> 31:48.766
Fang Muyang!

31:56.907 --> 31:57.786
Fang Muyang!

31:59.147 --> 32:00.867
Fei Ni!

32:22.306 --> 32:23.506
Are you okay?

32:29.893 --> 32:30.940
Where are Mom and Dad?

32:31.867 --> 32:32.667
Over there.

32:34.160 --> 32:35.060
Are you all right?

32:35.066 --> 32:36.147
Dad, Mom, I'm fine.

32:36.248 --> 32:37.340
Thank goodness you're okay.

32:38.066 --> 32:38.986
Where's Fei Ting?

32:39.740 --> 32:41.271
He went with Lin Mei

32:41.290 --> 32:42.347
to her parents' place.

32:44.907 --> 32:46.266
There'll probably be aftershocks.

32:47.066 --> 32:48.506
No one can go back inside now.

32:48.620 --> 32:50.293
When I was in Great Northern Wilderness,

32:50.310 --> 32:52.986
I went through an earthquake.
The sky looked just like this.

32:53.506 --> 32:54.499
Before it starts raining,

32:54.500 --> 32:55.715
we need to set up shelters.

32:55.937 --> 32:57.940
Do we still have the lumber
Fei Ting brought back?

32:58.986 --> 32:59.706
Over there

32:59.706 --> 33:00.466
by the wall.

33:00.546 --> 33:01.546
Dad, Mom,

33:01.546 --> 33:02.746
tell the neighbors

33:02.746 --> 33:04.347
to find as much oilcloth as they can.

33:04.546 --> 33:05.387
Plastic sheets too.

33:05.387 --> 33:06.466
Gather scrap wood.

33:06.466 --> 33:07.506
Before the aftershocks hit,

33:07.506 --> 33:09.147
go back in quickly and grab the cots,

33:09.147 --> 33:11.347
umbrellas, clothes, blankets,
and everything we'll need.

33:11.347 --> 33:11.786
Hurry.

33:11.786 --> 33:12.187
Okay.

33:12.187 --> 33:12.986
I'll go now.

33:12.986 --> 33:13.266
Okay.

33:13.715 --> 33:14.500
Everyone, listen!

33:14.667 --> 33:15.147
Fei Ni.

33:15.947 --> 33:16.746
Stay here.

33:17.266 --> 33:18.347
I'll go upstairs

33:18.587 --> 33:20.347
and get the tools for the shelter.

33:20.786 --> 33:21.947
I'm coming with you.

33:22.026 --> 33:22.699
No.

33:22.700 --> 33:24.271
The next aftershock could hit anytime.

33:24.746 --> 33:25.706
You're safest here.

33:26.226 --> 33:26.746
Wait for me.

33:35.466 --> 33:36.266
Fang Muyang.

33:37.026 --> 33:37.740
Why are you here?

33:37.746 --> 33:39.107
You might not know where things are.

33:39.107 --> 33:40.306
The toolbox is in the cabinet.

33:44.147 --> 33:45.306
Do we have oilcloth?

33:45.306 --> 33:46.147
Under the bed.

33:49.147 --> 33:49.746
Hurry up.

33:49.746 --> 33:50.706
Let's go.

33:53.786 --> 33:54.667
Fei Ni!

33:54.667 --> 33:55.306
Go!

33:57.546 --> 33:58.347
Quick!

34:01.387 --> 34:02.667
Come on, everyone!

34:02.667 --> 34:04.226
Let's get working!

34:26.227 --> 34:26.827
Here, Fei.

34:31.466 --> 34:32.066
Ready?

34:32.347 --> 34:33.026
Lift!

34:40.707 --> 34:41.506
Quick!

34:41.506 --> 34:42.586
Make every second count!

34:46.666 --> 34:47.506
Come on!

36:13.546 --> 36:14.227
Fang Muyang?

36:15.586 --> 36:16.546
What are you doing?

36:17.146 --> 36:18.707
You didn't seem to sleep well in there.

36:18.782 --> 36:20.293
I'm building you your own little room.

36:21.146 --> 36:21.546
No need.

36:21.546 --> 36:22.347
Come down.

36:22.347 --> 36:23.546
Come down and get some sleep.

36:24.707 --> 36:25.347
Coming.

36:41.307 --> 36:42.146
Welcome home.

36:51.986 --> 36:53.146
(Fei Ni's Home)
See?

36:53.707 --> 36:55.146
We have a home again.

37:02.747 --> 37:03.387
Yeah.

37:06.907 --> 37:08.146
Your first earthquake.

37:11.787 --> 37:13.066
Were you scared?

37:17.387 --> 37:18.227
I was.

37:29.787 --> 37:31.066
I'm not scared now.

37:42.085 --> 37:47.147
(Fei Ni's Home)

37:50.310 --> 37:52.672
(Comrades of Jiangcheng
No. 1 Textile Factory,)

37:52.735 --> 37:55.260
(I am Xu Hongqi,
Director of the Factory Office.)

37:55.626 --> 37:57.466
(The epicenter of this earthquake)

37:57.537 --> 37:59.590
(Unity brings greater victories)
(was in Beishan City,)

37:59.604 --> 38:01.648
(eight hundred kilometers
from Jiangcheng.)

38:01.760 --> 38:04.140
(The situation there
is extremely perilous.)

38:04.146 --> 38:08.986
(Advanced Unit)
It's our duty to offer aid.

38:09.387 --> 38:11.626
(Under the leadership
of the Party and the state,)

38:12.197 --> 38:16.210
(all sectors are actively
supporting the disaster area.)

38:16.397 --> 38:17.822
(As decided by the Party committee,)

38:17.935 --> 38:20.874
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory's
Workshop One)

38:20.874 --> 38:22.035
(and Workshop Three)

38:22.035 --> 38:25.234
will temporarily switch
to sewing relief tents.

38:27.227 --> 38:30.106
Though we cannot stand
on the front line of quake relief,

38:30.347 --> 38:31.227
the production line

38:31.427 --> 38:32.787
is the front line

38:33.506 --> 38:34.787
we must now defend

38:34.947 --> 38:36.347
with our lives.

38:36.506 --> 38:38.947
(For every extra tent you sew,)

38:38.960 --> 38:40.227
(the people in the disaster area)

38:40.227 --> 38:42.986
(will be spared
a little more wind and rain.)

38:43.347 --> 38:44.307
(The more)

38:44.307 --> 38:46.586
(you fulfill the production targets,)

38:46.907 --> 38:50.186
(the sooner the order
will be restored there.)

38:50.506 --> 38:53.506
(Every stitch
and every thread in your hands)

38:53.666 --> 38:57.106
is our strongest support
for the people in the disaster zone.

39:04.747 --> 39:06.066
Maodou, slow down.

39:06.186 --> 39:06.707
Okay.

39:06.707 --> 39:07.466
Bye.

39:08.466 --> 39:09.986
Can't you take the day off?

39:10.267 --> 39:11.506
I'm worried about aftershocks.

39:11.947 --> 39:13.747
All the more reason to go in.

39:13.747 --> 39:14.787
The factory's ordered us

39:14.787 --> 39:17.066
to work overtime
on quake-relief supplies.

39:17.586 --> 39:18.586
I'm one of the factory's

39:18.586 --> 39:19.586
Technician Award winners.

39:21.546 --> 39:22.787
I'll pick you up after work.

39:22.907 --> 39:23.747
Okay.

39:24.586 --> 39:25.666
You can stop here.

39:26.186 --> 39:27.586
You barely slept last night.

39:27.707 --> 39:28.907
Go home and get some rest.

39:29.146 --> 39:30.106
I'm fine.

39:30.106 --> 39:31.186
Don't worry about me.

39:31.347 --> 39:32.347
I'm strong as ever.

39:35.782 --> 39:38.010
(Modesty helps one progress.
Arrogance makes one fall behind.)

39:38.506 --> 39:40.066
Be careful at work, okay?

39:40.307 --> 39:41.787
If there's an aftershock, run outside.

39:42.387 --> 39:43.186
I know.

39:43.186 --> 39:44.066
Head back.

39:44.066 --> 39:44.867
I'll watch you go.

39:46.787 --> 39:47.666
I'm off.

39:47.666 --> 39:48.026
Okay.

39:48.026 --> 39:48.707
Go on now.

39:48.707 --> 39:49.307
See you tonight.

39:49.307 --> 39:50.026
Alright.

39:52.106 --> 39:53.146
Stay safe.

39:53.466 --> 39:54.506
Got it.

40:00.466 --> 40:01.267
Yang.

40:05.827 --> 40:06.267
Ow...

40:06.267 --> 40:07.106
Easy, easy!

40:07.546 --> 40:08.867
Is this even helping?

40:09.347 --> 40:09.787
Mom.

40:09.787 --> 40:10.867
Don't nitpick.

40:11.106 --> 40:12.666
The clinic's packed.

40:12.666 --> 40:13.787
They can't get to us.

40:14.307 --> 40:15.106
This is

40:15.106 --> 40:16.867
what Fei Ting went home to get.

40:18.347 --> 40:19.947
Dad, your shoulder

40:19.947 --> 40:21.707
probably got strained.

40:21.707 --> 40:22.307
It's fine.

40:22.493 --> 40:23.300
Careful, it's hot.

40:23.307 --> 40:24.347
Oh, now you're the expert?

40:24.347 --> 40:26.586
I set a cow's broken leg before.

40:26.747 --> 40:28.186
A bone injury isn't the same as this.

40:29.546 --> 40:30.186
While it's hot.

40:35.347 --> 40:37.387
Fei Ting, go take care of your work.

40:37.448 --> 40:39.810
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory
must be swamped right now.

40:39.826 --> 40:41.160
I've got things here. Don't worry.

40:41.427 --> 40:41.947
Go on.

40:43.986 --> 40:44.787
Mom,

40:44.787 --> 40:45.307
actually,

40:45.307 --> 40:45.986
He is...

40:46.506 --> 40:47.986
taking the day off.

40:48.787 --> 40:51.066
The Publicity Division can't
really help much right now.

40:53.307 --> 40:53.986
All set, Dad.

40:53.986 --> 40:54.787
Yeah.

40:56.387 --> 40:57.347
I'm heading to work.

40:58.293 --> 40:59.471
You're really not...

41:00.867 --> 41:02.267
Mom, have some water.

41:07.466 --> 41:08.666
Fei Ting, come here a second.

41:11.822 --> 41:12.410
Yeah.

41:15.337 --> 41:17.360
What is it?

41:18.347 --> 41:19.186
Remember this.

41:19.787 --> 41:20.986
Do not let my parents find out

41:20.986 --> 41:22.787
you lost the job.

41:23.546 --> 41:24.307
I can't

41:24.307 --> 41:25.146
take their nagging.

41:26.066 --> 41:26.739
All right.

41:26.740 --> 41:27.626
I'll do as you say.

41:43.747 --> 41:44.586
Magnitude 7.5.

41:46.066 --> 41:46.867
That serious?

41:47.146 --> 41:47.947
Yes.

41:48.947 --> 41:49.947
For now,

41:49.947 --> 41:52.739
we still don't know
the full situation at the epicenter.

41:52.740 --> 41:54.830
The Central Committee attaches
great importance to it.

41:54.848 --> 41:56.093
Orders have already been issued

41:56.204 --> 41:57.500
to spare no effort

41:57.986 --> 42:00.947
to rescue the people
and protect their lives and property.

42:01.747 --> 42:03.787
Our newspaper has
also received instructions

42:03.907 --> 42:04.907
to send reporters

42:04.907 --> 42:07.466
to the front lines of quake relief
for on-site coverage.

42:08.267 --> 42:09.106
The organization

42:09.106 --> 42:11.347
also hopes to turn stories
from the relief efforts

42:11.626 --> 42:13.267
into illustrated serials

42:13.827 --> 42:15.707
so that more people

42:15.707 --> 42:17.867
can understand
what's happening in the disaster area.

42:17.867 --> 42:20.106
But the newsroom is short-staffed.

42:23.666 --> 42:24.466
I'll go.

42:29.146 --> 42:30.707
The epicenter's dangerous.

42:32.347 --> 42:33.947
Besides, you just got married.

42:33.947 --> 42:34.586
Uncle Fu,

42:35.582 --> 42:37.004
I'm not afraid of danger.

42:38.226 --> 42:40.140
I came back
from Great Northern Wilderness.

42:40.747 --> 42:41.907
I know how to survive.

42:42.546 --> 42:44.506
I can do carpentry.
I can build shelters.

42:45.867 --> 42:47.387
I might even help with rescue work.

42:51.747 --> 42:52.986
To be honest,

42:52.986 --> 42:54.387
I've thought about it for a while.

42:54.867 --> 42:55.986
In your training class,

42:55.986 --> 42:58.626
you're the only one
with that kind of capability.

42:58.787 --> 42:59.626
Go home.

42:59.710 --> 43:00.710
Let your family know.

43:01.035 --> 43:02.194
Pack lightly.

43:02.546 --> 43:03.867
The necessary supplies

43:04.307 --> 43:05.907
have already been prepared.

43:06.147 --> 43:07.306
In one hour,

43:07.872 --> 43:09.191
we leave from the office.

43:09.747 --> 43:10.546
That soon?

43:12.122 --> 43:12.923
Is there a problem?

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
